Emerald Oasis Spas is looking for a skilled and passionate Marketing Executive to join their team, drive revenue growth, and strengthen client relationships. This role is crucial in driving business growth, expanding our market presence, and delivering outstanding customer service. 

Key responsibilities
Engage with online leads to understand their wellness goals and backyard requirements;
Discusses business methods, products or services and targets customer group with employer or client in order to identify marketing requirements;
