&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our unified supply chain planning platform helps retailers and manufacturers&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;demand forecasting, replenishment, pricing, promotions, and operations. With over 2,000 professionals worldwide, we help customers increase product availability, reduce waste, and drive profitable growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
